WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
A hand sketches a mobile form on paper.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The screen shows the sketch beside a mobile preview.
Two labeled fields take shape.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.700
An arrow inside the last rectangle becomes a button
at the bottom of the form.
